          "solutionExcerpt": "드모르간의 법칙으로\n$A^C\\cup B^C=(A\\cap B)^C$이다.\n따라서\n$n(A^C\\cup B^C)=30-n(A\\cap B)$이다.\n포함배제에 의해\n$n(A\\cup B)=20+15-n(A\\cap B)$이다.\n$A\\cup B\\subseteq U$이므로\n$20+15-n(A\\cap B",
          "observation": "Opened Venn SVG shows overlap y and non-overlap regions; y≥20+15−30=5 matches the minimum-overlap statement.",
